      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, private banking, Rachel Lim speaking. Hello, Mr Tan. Are you somewhere you can speak privately? I can keep the conversation brief if you have another meeting coming up."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Rachel. Yes, I'm in my office with the door closed. I've got my records beside me. Quite a busy morning, so I'll speak a bit quickly, but let me settle down first."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "No problem, take your time. Before we get into the call, please give me your identification details for the usual verification."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_011]] [[EV_012]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. While I bring up your account, are telephone appointments still the most convenient way for us to catch up?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Yes, much easier than coming down to the branch. My routine has changed recently. I'm spending more mornings in the office instead of travelling, but the afternoons are full of calls with our regional teams."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "We can keep future appointments by phone. If your diary changes, just let me know beforehand. Has the new routine made it easier to keep some space between meetings?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "A little. I used to rush straight from one call into another. Now I leave a short gap and get my papers ready. Otherwise I spend half the conversation looking for the right page."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "That sounds more manageable. I have your account open now, so you can refer to your record while we talk."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Right, I've found the page. [[EV_014]] [[EV_013]] [[EV_018]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_001]] [[EV_002]] [[EV_006]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]] [[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I'll speak more slowly for this part. [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_019]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for taking the call, Mr Tan. For future appointments, I'll use your usual contact number. You can contact me directly if you need to rearrange a slot."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Good, that suits me. I prefer speaking to the same person rather than explaining my schedule again. Thanks, Rachel. I'll let you get back to your morning. Bye."
        },
